      "fieldtype": "line_item_description",
      "line_item_id": 1,
      "page": 0,
      "text": "Monthly rental of CSM - 2082 with FMI pump and Infra\nred lamp or resistive ignition as described below:\nThe Jaeger-Baumgartner CSM 2082 as currently\nconfigured will allow for puffs at 60, 30, 20 and 15\nsecond intervals (requires multiple pumps, only two port\npumps supplied) while operating in the one RPM mode.\nPuff duration is two seconds with opening and closing\ntimes per port being symmetric and consistent with FTC\nand ISO specifications. Charging and lighting of each\ncigarette can be done in discontinuous and continuos\nrotational modes. Ignition ofeach cigarette can be with\ngas flame, electrical resistance heating and Infra Red\nigniters. Ignition can occur with preheating at - 2 seconds\n(with or without a puff) and at time zero."
    },
